# Wyndon, Galar's capital at the north end of the line: a grand civic march in D for the city of the Champion Cup,
# brass over the orchestra's strings, timpani on the downbeats and a snare that keeps the parade's step; at night a
# horn takes the tune and the band lies back.
# Original composition for this game (plan 33 · GL7), in the modern sound. Not wired yet: galar/wedgehurst stands in
# for Wyndon until the user has heard it (rulings, "After the Hall of Fame in Galar").
